      "title": "Az National Trucking – Hadoop, Hive & Tableau Big Data Analytics",
      "description": "Ingested 8,000+ geolocation records and a 100-driver fleet dataset into HDFS using Cloudera Hadoop (HDP), created Hive tables via DDL, and queried data through Apache Impala connected to Tableau via ODBC driver for large-scale operational analytics. Built interactive Tableau dashboards analyzing unsafe driving events across 100 drivers and multiple truck models, identifying geographic hotspots and risk scores through behavioral analysis to surface key predictors of fleet safety and fuel efficiency. Delivered data-driven recommendations for route optimization and driver coaching, translating complex geospatial and behavioral patterns into actionable fleet performance insights for operational stakeholders.",
